<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport"Index. html content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Krishna Supply Chain</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#263449;line-height:1.6}
header{background:#102d50;color:white;padding:22px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
header h2{color:#f5b942}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:8px;font-size:14px}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#102d50,#176b87);color:white;text-align:center;padding:85px 20px}
.hero h1{font-size:38px;margin-bottom:15px}
.hero p{font-size:18px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#f5b942;color:#102d50;padding:12px 25px;margin-top:22px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold}
section{padding:55px 7%;text-align:center}
section h2{font-size:29px;color:#102d50;margin-bottom:20px}
.about{background:#f2f6fa}
.services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:30px}
.service{padding:25px;background:#f2f6fa;border-radius:10px;border-bottom:4px solid #f5b942}
.service h3{color:#176b87;margin-bottom:10px}
.contact{background:#102d50;color:white}
.contact h2{color:#f5b942}
footer{background:#091c32;color:white;text-align:center;padding:18px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h2>KRISHNA SUPPLY CHAIN</h2>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Welcome to Krishna Supply Chain</h1>
<p>Your Trusted Partner in Supply Chain & Logistics Solutions</p>
<a href="#services" class="btn">Explore Our Services</a>
</div>

<section class="about" id="about">
<h2>About Us</h2>
<p>Krishna Supply Chain is focused on professional supply chain operations, warehouse management, inventory control and logistics solutions. Our goal is to support efficient material movement and reliable store operations.</p>
</section>

<section id="services">
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<div class="services">
<div class="service">
<h3>Warehouse Management</h3>
<p>Organized storage and warehouse operations.</p>
</div>
<div class="service">
<h3>Inventory Management</h3>
<p>Stock monitoring, inventory control and records.</p>
</div>
<div class="service">
<h3>Logistics Support</h3>
<p>Material movement and transportation coordination.</p>
</div>
<div class="service">
<h3>Supply Chain Solutions</h3>
<p>Efficient material planning and supply operations.</p>
</div>
<div class="service">
<h3>Store Management</h3>
<p>Material receiving, issuing and stock management.</p>
</div>
<div class="service">
<h3>Dispatch Management</h3>
<p>Dispatch coordination and documentation support.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>For business enquiries and supply chain support, please contact our team.</p>
<p>Krishna Supply Chain</p>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Krishna Supply Chain. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
